Fermi_surf_band_1.bxsf                    ! Filename (50 chars. max). Only choose the first one, the program read the rest automatically
    0.000000                     ! Fermi energy (Rydbergy). 1 eV = 0.0734985857 Ry
 60                             ! Interpolated number of points per single side. 999 is the maximmun for paralell running, due to memory issue. Exceeding 999, the program will randomly choose a value
  0.000000                       ! Theta (degrees) (Azimuthal angle). Only used for non-autorotation computation. For autorotation computation, this will be ignored automatically
  0.000000                       ! Phi (degrees) (Polar angle). Only used for non-autorotation computation. For autorotation computation, this will be ignored automatically
r                                ! H-vector direction: a, b, c, n for non-principal axis, or r for auto-rotation
  0.0000                         ! Minimum extremal FS freq. (kT)
  0.010                          ! Maximum fractional diff. between orbit freqs. for averaging
  0.050                          ! Maximum distance between orbit avg. coords. for averaging
y                                ! Allow extremal orbits near super-cell walls?
  0.000000                       ! Starting theta (degrees) (Azimuthal angle)
  0.000000                       ! Ending theta (degrees) (Azimuthal angle)
  0.000000                       ! Starting phi (degrees) (Polar angle)
 90.000000                       ! Ending phi (degrees) (Polar angle)
   19                            ! Number of rotation angles. Set 1 for non-autorotation computations
   